`_copy_subtree` iterative post-order to avoid recursion:
```
def _copy_subtree(self, node):
    stack = [(node, False)]
    result = {}
    while stack:
        n, processed = stack.pop()
        if processed:
            children = [result[id(c)] for c in n.children]
            result[id(n)] = Tree(n.label, children)
        else:
            stack.append((n, True))
            for c in reversed(n.children):
                stack.append((c, False))
    return result[id(node)]
```
